    <item>
      <title>高盛本月第二次削减中国股票的目标</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/goldman-sachs-cuts-targets-for-china-stocks-second-time-in-april</link>
      <description><![CDATA[高盛集团公司（Goldman Sachs Group Inc.）的战略家本月第二次削减了中国主要股票指数的目标，理由是与美国与美国的贸易紧张局势加剧。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/goldman-sachs-cuts-targets-for-china-stocks-second-time-in-april</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 00:35:03 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>随着美元削弱，股票上涨技术关税暂停：市场包装</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</link>
      <description><![CDATA[唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）总统在一系列消费电子产品上停止进口关税后，股票上升，随着交易者为在市场上进一步波动而提高情绪。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 22:40:41 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>当关税传奇卷起时，美元延长至六个月低点</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/dollar-finds-support-for-now-as-trump-pauses-electronics-levies</link>
      <description><![CDATA[由于担心特朗普政府关税政策的混乱将使交易者远离美国资产，因此美元削弱了六个月的低点。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/dollar-finds-support-for-now-as-trump-pauses-electronics-levies</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 21:09:18 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
